      "title": "We're Hiring!",
      "description": "Current Vacancies - JCU Australia Current Opportunities Applicant Login My Profile Kiosk mode We're Hiring! Skip to jobs search results Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search -Categories- -Categories- Academic (4) Professional (19) -Employment Types- -Employment Types- Casual (5) Full time (15) Part time (2) -Cities- -Cities- Cairns (8) Mackay (1) Townsville (17) Grounds Officer Townsville Professional Full time Closing on: Sep 20 2026 Enjoy working outdoors while helping maintain and enhance the vibrant tropical landscapes that make JCU unique. Read more Management Accountant Townsville Professional Full time Closing on: Sep 6 2026 Join a collaborative finance team where you'll apply your accounting, modelling and advisory expertise to support decision-making, solve complex challenges and influence positive outcomes. Build strong relationships, deliver practical financial solutions and make a meaningful contribution across the University. Read more Head of Dentistry Cairns Academic Full time Closing on: Sep 27 2026 Lead JCU's discipline of Dentistry and help shape the future of dental education, research and clinical practice across northern Australia and beyond. Read more Financial Services Officer Townsville Professional Full time Closing on: Sep 6 2026 Join a supportive finance team where you'll process corporate credit card and travel transactions, help staff navigate financial policies and procedures, support compliance requirements, and deliver high-quality financial services to the University community. Read more Research Worker Townsville Professional Part time Closing on: Sep 6 2026 Provide essential operational and laboratory support to ensure project milestones are delivered efficiently and to a high standard. Read more Casual Collection Assistant Cairns Professional Casual Closing on: Sep 11 2026 Looking for flexible work while you study? Join the Cairns Library team and make a positive impact on the student experience. Read more Digital Spaces Engineer Cairns Professional Full time Closing on: Sep 20 2026 Use your technical expertise to create seamless digital experiences across JCU's learning, teaching and collaboration spaces. Read more Casual HDR Program Support Officer Townsville Professional Casual Closing on: Sep 13 2026 Assist with candidature administration, milestone tracking and high‑quality support for HDR candidates and supervisors. Read more Administrative Officer Townsville Professional Full time Closing on: Sep 4 2026 Deliver high-quality administrative support that enhances operational effectiveness, provides exceptional service, and contributes to the success of James Cook University. Read more Team Leader, HDR Program Support Townsville Professional Full time Closing on: Sep 13 2026 Provide high-level support and operational management to the HDR Program Support team within the Graduate Research School (GRS), coordinating and delivering efficient, high-quality administrative and academic support services for HDR candidates and staff. Read more Lecturer / Senior Lecturer, Social Work Cairns Townsville Academic Full time Closing on: Sep 27 2026 The appointee will be responsible for both the development of innovative and contemporary Social Work and Human Services professional pathway course materials and the delivery of teaching in undergraduate and postgraduate Social Work  and Human Services programs, in particular, the Bachelor of Social Work, Bachelor of Social Work (Honours), Bachelor of Human Services,and Master of Social Work (Professional Qualifying) and Master of Human Services. The appointee will conduct research and publish high-quality publications in the field of Social Work and/or related cognate disciplines and supervise Higher Degree Research candidates in this field. The appointee will support community engagement and work collaboratively with agencies,  Social Work and Human Services partners in the region and support the University’s Strategic Intent. Read more Casual Enrolment Help Assistant Cairns Townsville Professional Casual Closing on: Sep 8 2026 Help students start their university journey with confidence. Join JCU as a Casual Enrolment Help Assistant, providing friendly support and practical guidance during busy enrolment periods while gaining valuable customer service and administration experience in a dynamic student-focused environment. Read more Business Services Accountant Townsville Professional Full time Closing on: Sep 8 2026 Bring your accounting expertise to a role where finance, governance and strategic impact come together. Working alongside senior leaders and boards, you'll help drive sound financial oversight, support informed decision-making and contribute to the success of JCU's controlled entities. Read more Animal Ethics Officer Townsville Academic Professional Part time Closing on: Sep 6 2026 Support the Animal Ethics Committee and JCU researchers to ensure animal research and teaching activities are managed ethically and in line with legislative requirements. The role combines high-level administration, informed advice and attention to detail to support effective animal ethics review, compliance and governance across the University Read more Research Training and Researcher Development Advisor Townsville Professional Full time Closing on: Sep 13 2026 Enhance the HDR, HDR Advisor, and Researcher experience by delivering a contemporary and engaging program of activities that support research training and researcher development. Read more Teaching Support Officer Cairns Professional Full time Closing on: Sep 13 2026 Passionate about education and administration? Join JCU and help deliver outstanding teaching support through coordination, administration, and data management. Read more HR Advisor Townsville Professional Full time Closing on: Sep 6 2026 Be part of something new. Bring your energy. Make a meaningful impact.  \n\nProvide contemporary HR advice across the employment lifecycle \nSupport leaders with employee relations, performance and organisational change \nContribute to workforce planning and quality talent acquisition outcomes Read more Educational Designer Cairns Townsville Professional Full time Closing on: Sep 13 2026 Apply your expertise in curriculum design, pedagogy, and educational technologies to shape transformative learning experiences and contribute to excellence in higher education. Read more Collection Development Librarian Townsville Professional Full time Closing on: Sep 6 2026 Step into a pivotal role where you will help shape and enhance JCU’s scholarly collections to support outstanding learning, teaching, and research. Read more Expression of Interest – Veterinary Clinical Academic Opportunities Townsville Academic Full time Closing on: Sep 6 2026 Join one of the world's most distinctive veterinary schools and help tackle the animal, agricultural and biosecurity challenges that matter most to Northern Australia and the tropics. Read more Casual EOI - Laboratory and Technical Support Cairns Townsville Professional Casual Closing on: Oct 31 2026 Please submit your interest for the Casual EOI - Laboratory and Technical Support. Read more Casual Nursing Technical Support - Mackay Mackay Professional Casual Closing on: Sep 25 2026 Please submit your interest for Casual Nursing Technical Support in Mackay. Read more Displaying all 22 entries Powered by PageUp Facebook Twitter LinkedIn © James Cook University 1995 to 2026 | Cookie Preferences Candidate Details This website uses cookies. We use cookies to personalise content such as job recommendations, and to analyse our traffic. You consent to our cookies if you click \"I Accept\". If you click on \"I Do Not Accept\", then we will not use cookies but you may have a deteriorated user experience. You can change your settings by clicking on the Settings link on the top right of the device I do not accept I accept"
