      "title": "We're Hiring!",
      "description": "Casual HDR Program Support Officer - Townsville, QLD, Australia Current Opportunities Applicant Login My Profile Kiosk mode We're Hiring! Casual HDR Program Support Officer 495720 Townsville Professional Casual Closing on: Sep 13 2026 Add to favourites View favourites Graduate Research School (Townsville) $52.04 - $59.02 per hour We’re seeking a motivated casual HDR Program Support Officer to assist with candidature administration, milestone tracking and high‑quality support for HDR candidates and supervisors. You’ll help manage key processes across admissions, enrolments, variations, examinations and completions, while providing responsive customer service and accurate record‑keeping This role suits someone with strong organisational skills, attention to detail, confidence using enterprise systems, and the ability to work both independently and as part of a busy team. This position is based in Townsville and requires on-campus attendance. Current JCU students are not eligible to apply. How to Apply and Contact Details Apply now and help us create a healthier, more sustainable future for the Tropics. Click the ‘Apply’ button or visit the JCU Careers Page and follow these steps: Complete the application form Upload your current resume For further information, contact Gabby Ryan via email gabby.ryan@jcu.edu.au JCU celebrates diversity and is committed to creating a safe, inclusive, and welcoming environment for all. We encourage applications from people of all backgrounds who meet the role requirements. Back to job listing Apply Now First Name (required) ef623f54 Last Name (required) 3ea04711 Email (required) bc3bc404 Refer someone to this job Apply Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Recommended for you Grounds Officer Townsville Professional Enjoy working outdoors while helping maintain and enhance the vibrant tropical landscapes that make JCU unique. Head of Dentistry Cairns Academic Lead JCU's discipline of Dentistry and help shape the fut